    "html": "<div></div><div><div>同样用 WorkBuddy，为什么别人一天干完的活，你要磨三天？说实话，差的不是模型，是这 7 个 skill。想要文档版，一键三连，后台回复【skill】自取～</div><div>1️⃣web-hot，全网热搜雷达</div><div>2️⃣agent-browser，让它自己上手操作浏览器 </div><div>3️⃣一套专治 PPT的组合拳 </div><div>4️⃣find-skills，专门帮你装技能的技能</div><div>5️⃣文档三件套</div><div>6️⃣summarize，速读外挂。 </div><div>7️⃣Agent Memory，让它真正记住你。</div><div><img src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OGUi0Nf3UxVC7ygH_-46BD6Exfa8LCm4Cn0c2t_12xpw8AA/1000\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：图片\"></div><div><img src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OAOo6BRcF-hLvZNYfZLJYPaFdFltn0YArpmRqqdyzh5JkAA/1000\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：图片\"></div><div><img src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/Op5WyCJEAzJBF_k6gwM9TWAhDLozCigfBvDolP59A7AdQAA/1000\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：图片\"></div><div><img src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OkAdz1J08pkEF_FlxxbJPVe-T0QAUuFNR5J0A_oGGOelkAA/1000\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：图片\"></div><div><img src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/ONOG4wtbZjlaTG72Z0TZrapqleehKZD97ZsYHd40ryAhUAA/1000\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：图片\"></div><div><img src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/Ox1ZpH_0A5h5hO0rLNE_8Ow65Mcrp-lpT06SnLeHbfVlgAA/1000\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：图片\"></div><div><img src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/O_W60zRpKEOSToTGxyrNOuJILIsa_vMQaB5q0AK_gnMLkAA/1000\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"查看大图：图片